{"seq":2,"slug":"barrier-encryption-key-hierarchy","title":"Barrier 加密、根密钥层级与 Transit 加密即服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/vault-storage-barrier/barrier-encryption-key-hierarchy","wordCount":2542,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"barrier-加密-根密钥层级与-transit-加密即服务\">Barrier 加密、根密钥层级与 Transit 加密即服务</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Vault 的安全模型不是&quot;把 secret 存进保险箱&quot;，而是<strong>一条三层密钥链</strong>：unseal key（或云 KMS 主密钥）保护 root key，root key 派生 keyring，keyring 里的 barrier key 才是逐条加密数据的 AES 密钥。任何一层被绕过，下层密文就形同明文；只要 root key 不落盘，拿到整个物理存储的人也读不出任何 secret。这条链把&quot;轮换&quot;从 O(N) 降到 O(1)：业务数据可能几十万条，需要重新加密的只有 root key（几十字节）和 keyring（KB 级）。Hashicorp 官方文档把 Barrier 描述为 Vault 的 &quot;cryptographic barrier&quot;——所有数据写入物理后端前都经它加密，密文与<strong>存储路径</strong>绑定（<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/internals/architecture\">Vault Architecture</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;unseal keys / 云 KMS 主密钥&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;root key&lt;br/&gt;32 字节随机值&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;HKDF-SHA256&lt;br/&gt;每 term 派生一把&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;keyring&lt;br/&gt;term + 多版本 barrier key&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;AES-256-GCM&lt;br/&gt;path 作 AAD&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;physical.Backend&lt;br/&gt;core/keyring, logical/**&quot;]&#10;    G[&quot;Transit engine&lt;br/&gt;加密即服务&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;独立密钥环&quot;| H[&quot;vault:v3:base64&lt;br/&gt;可直接落业务库&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"unseal keys / 云 KMS 主密钥\"] --&gt; B[\"root key&lt;br/&gt;32 字节随机值\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"HKDF-SHA256&lt;br/&gt;每 term 派生一把\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"keyring&lt;br/&gt;term + 多版本 barrier key\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"AES-256-GCM&lt;br/&gt;path 作 AAD\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"physical.Backend&lt;br/&gt;core/keyring, logical/**\"]\n    G[\"Transit engine&lt;br/&gt;加密即服务\"] -.-&gt;|\"独立密钥环\"| H[\"vault:v3:base64&lt;br/&gt;可直接落业务库\"]</pre><p>虚线揭示一个常被混淆的点：<strong>Transit engine 的密钥与 Barrier 密钥是两套独立体系</strong>。Barrier 保护 Vault 自己的存储；Transit 是 Vault 对外的&quot;加密 API&quot;，其产出密文给外部系统（订单表、支付网关日志、买家 PII 字段）用，可离开 Vault 独立存在——这是&quot;加密即服务&quot;与&quot;加密存储&quot;的根本区别。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型长度</th>\n<th>存储形态</th>\n<th>轮换操作</th>\n<th>泄露后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>unseal key / KMS 主密钥</td>\n<td>Shamir 份额 或 KMS 托管</td>\n<td>运维离线保管 / 云 KMS</td>\n<td><code>operator rekey</code></td>\n<td>攻击者可解出 root key</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>root key（master key）</td>\n<td>32 字节</td>\n<td>KMS 加密后存 <code>core/master</code>，或从不落盘</td>\n<td><code>operator rekey</code></td>\n<td>等价于全量失守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>barrier key（keyring）</td>\n<td>每 term 32 字节</td>\n<td>root key 加密后存 <code>core/keyring</code></td>\n<td><code>operator rotate</code></td>\n<td>解出历史 term 的数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"根密钥层级-从-unseal-key-到-barrier-key\">根密钥层级：从 unseal key 到 barrier key</h2><p>初始化时，Vault 用 <code>crypto/rand</code> 生成一把 32 字节 root key。它必须能在重启后恢复，又绝不能以明文躺在磁盘上，Vault 用<strong>两种互斥的 seal 机制</strong>解决。</p>\n<p><strong>Shamir seal（默认）。</strong> root key 本身不落盘，Vault 用 Shamir 秘密共享把它拆成 <code>key_shares</code> 份，凑齐 <code>key_threshold</code> 份即可重构，这几份就是初始化返回的 <strong>unseal keys</strong>。数学基础是 1979 年 Shamir 在 CACM 发表的方案：构造 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) = a_0 + a_1 x + \\cdots + a_{t-1}x^{t-1} \\pmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0224em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.4444em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是秘密、其余系数随机，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 份份额是点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_i, f(x_i))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>；任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个点唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 从而恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个点信息论上零泄露。常见配置 5 份门槛 3 份（<code>-key-shares=5 -key-threshold=3</code>），单点泄露或单份遗失都不致命（<a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/359168.359176\">Shamir 1979</a>，<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/concepts/seal\">Vault Seal</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>Auto-unseal seal。</strong> 份额分发在自动化环境里很痛苦——重启后要人工凑齐 3 个人，7×24 的促销大促期间不可接受。auto-unseal 改为用云 KMS/HSM 的一把主密钥（KEK）加密 root key，把密文持久化回存储；节点启动时直接调 KMS 的 Decrypt 接口取回，信任根从&quot;人持有的份额&quot;转移到&quot;云 IAM + KMS key policy&quot;。代价是 KMS 权限成为新单点——能调 <code>kms:Decrypt</code> 的身份等价于能 unseal Vault，该 IAM 角色必须严格限定到 Vault 节点实例身份。</p>\n<p>取回 root key 后，Vault 用 HKDF（RFC 5869 的 Extract-then-Expand）以 SHA-256 派生一把 32 字节 barrier key（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{PRK} = \\mathrm{HMAC}(\\mathrm{salt}, \\mathrm{IKM})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">PRK</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HMAC</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">salt</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">IKM</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再 Expand 得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{OKM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OKM</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。派生结果连同 <code>term</code>（递增代数编号）组成 <strong>keyring</strong>，加密后存于 <code>core/keyring</code>，最新一把用于<strong>加密</strong>、历史 key 保留用于<strong>解密</strong>旧数据——这就是轮换 barrier key 不需重写业务数据的原因（细节见 <code>vault/keyring.go</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"barrier-加密的实现细节\">Barrier 加密的实现细节</h2><p>Barrier 的原语是 <strong>AES-256-GCM</strong>（<code>vault/barrier_aes_gcm.go</code>），一个 AEAD 模式：同一把 key 既保证机密性又保证完整性，任何对密文的篡改都会在解密时以认证失败报错，而不是悄悄返回错误明文。GCM 认证标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mi>H</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = \\mathrm{GHASH}_{H}(A \\,\\|\\, C) \\oplus E_K(J_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">GHASH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = E_K(0^{128})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是附加认证数据、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是密文、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是初始计数器块（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/38/d/final\">NIST SP 800-38D</a>）。两点设计值得单独记住：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>存储路径作为 AAD。</strong> Vault 把条目的 key（如 <code>logical/2f31.../orders/db-pass</code>）作为 AAD 传给 GCM，让密文与它的逻辑位置<strong>密码学绑定</strong>——攻击者把某条高权限 secret 的密文复制到另一路径下，解密会直接失败。AAD 不加密但参与认证，是零成本的位置防篡改。</li>\n<li><strong>密文自带版本号。</strong> 写入物理后端的一个 value 布局是 <code>[4 字节 term][nonce][ciphertext + 16 字节 tag]</code>，term 用大端序编码在头部。读取时先解出 term，从 keyring 挑出对应版本的 barrier key 再解密——这是 keyring 保留多版本、轮换平滑过渡的物理基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Seal Wrap</strong> 面向 FIPS 合规场景，被标记的条目（keyring、transit 密钥材料等）会在 Barrier 之外<strong>再套一层</strong> HSM/KMS 加密，形成&quot;Barrier + seal&quot;双层结构，密钥明文不以明文形态长久驻留内存（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/140-3/final\">FIPS 140-3</a>）。留意一个时间点：CMVP 已停止接受新的 FIPS 140-2 提交，且全部 FIPS 140-2 证书在 2026 年 9 月 21 日被移入历史列表——<strong>2026 年下半年之后新建的合规部署应直接锚定 FIPS 140-3 验证模块</strong>，继续引用 140-2 证书在审计中已无说服力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轮换-rotate-与-rekey-的分工\">轮换：rotate 与 rekey 的分工</h2><p>这两个命令名字相近、作用域完全不同，区分只需问一句：<strong>要换的是哪一层密钥？</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;operator rotate&lt;br/&gt;换 barrier key&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;keyring 新增 term&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;旧 term 保留解密能力&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;业务数据零重写&quot;]&#10;    E[&quot;operator rekey&lt;br/&gt;换 root key&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;生成新 root key&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;重新加密 keyring&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;unseal keys 全部作废&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;业务数据仍然零重写&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"operator rotate&lt;br/&gt;换 barrier key\"] --&gt; B[\"keyring 新增 term\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"旧 term 保留解密能力\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"业务数据零重写\"]\n    E[\"operator rekey&lt;br/&gt;换 root key\"] --&gt; F[\"生成新 root key\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"重新加密 keyring\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"unseal keys 全部作废\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"业务数据仍然零重写\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><code>vault operator rotate</code></th>\n<th><code>vault operator rekey</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更换对象</td>\n<td>keyring 中的 barrier key</td>\n<td>root key 本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密码学效果</td>\n<td>新增 term，旧 term 保留可解密</td>\n<td>新 root key 重新加密 keyring</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需 threshold 份 unseal key 授权</td>\n<td>否（active 节点可直接执行）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unseal keys 是否变化</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td><strong>全部作废，需重新分发</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务数据是否重写</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型触发频率</td>\n<td>按合规周期（如每 90 天）自动轮换</td>\n<td>安全事件、人员离职、定期密钥卫生</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键工程结论：<strong>这两个操作都不重写业务数据。</strong> 数据只被 barrier key 加密，而 barrier key 又被 root key 加密——换上层只需重新加密上层那把 key，密文本身不动。这正是分层密钥设计的回报，也让&quot;每 90 天轮换一次&quot;从昂贵的全量重加密变成秒级操作。</p>\n<p><code>rekey</code> 之后必须立刻安全分发新的 unseal keys 并销毁旧份额。旧份额虽解不出新 root key，但若它们在轮换前已泄露、且攻击者同步拿走当时的 keyring 备份，历史数据仍可能被解出——这类&quot;先窃取、后解密&quot;的威胁对留存期以年计的合规数据（买家 PII、支付记录）尤其现实。缓解手段是同时执行 <code>rotate</code> 并配合 <code>min_encryption_version</code>，让新数据只能用新 term。</p>\n<h2 id=\"transit-加密即服务\">Transit 加密即服务</h2><p>Transit engine 是 Vault 把 Barrier 内部那套密钥管理能力<strong>产品化对外</strong>的结果：应用不再自己管密钥，而是把明文发给 Vault、拿回密文存进自己的数据库。它解决的是&quot;应用服务器内存和配置里不该有长期密钥&quot;的问题——数据库连接串轮换、订单 PII 字段加密、支付令牌化都靠它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"vault write -f transit/keys/order-pii type=aes256-gcm96 auto_rotate_period=720h&#10;vault write transit/encrypt/order-pii plaintext=$(base64 &lt;&lt;&lt; &quot;buyer@example.com&quot;)&#10;# =&gt; ciphertext: vault:v1:8SDd3WHDOjf7mq69CyCqYjBXAiQQAVZRkFM13ok481zoCmHnSeDX9vy7lZ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> transit/keys/order-pii</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> type=aes256-gcm96</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> auto_rotate_period=720h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vault</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> transit/encrypt/order-pii</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plaintext=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">base64</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"buyer@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># => ciphertext: vault:v1:8SDd3WHDOjf7mq69CyCqYjBXAiQQAVZRkFM13ok481zoCmHnSeDX9vy7lZ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>密文格式固定为 <code>vault:v&lt;N&gt;:&lt;base64&gt;</code>，自带密钥版本。</strong> 这个 <code>v&lt;N&gt;</code> 让解密方无需外部元数据就能选对密钥版本，也让版本滚动天然向后兼容：老密文照常解，新写入用最新版，避免了&quot;密文与密钥版本对照表&quot;这种脆弱的外部状态。滚动版本时用 <code>vault write transit/rewrap/order-pii ciphertext=...</code>，不要&quot;解密再加密&quot;——<code>rewrap</code> 在 Vault 内部换版本，明文从不出 Vault。</p>\n<p><strong>信封加密（DEK/KEK）是最常见的企业级模式。</strong> 用 <code>transit/datakey/plaintext/order-pii</code> 让 Vault 生成一把 data key：返回的 <code>plaintext</code> 只在内存里用一次去加密大块业务数据，<code>ciphertext</code>（被 KEK 包裹的 data key）随数据落库。这既避免把海量字段逐条发给 Vault 的性能瓶颈，又保证长期密钥始终不出 Vault——是 KEK 轮换只影响 data key、不触碰业务数据的关键。</p>\n<p><strong>密钥类型覆盖对称、非对称与后量子。</strong> <code>aes256-gcm96</code> 是默认对称 AEAD，无 AES-NI 的边缘节点可换 <code>chacha20-poly1305</code>；非对称有 <code>rsa-2048/3072/4096</code>（发布公钥、混合加密，但加解密慢）、<code>ecdsa-p256/384/521</code> 与 <code>ed25519</code>（签名）；<code>hmac</code> 只做完整性或等值判定，适合盲索引；较新版本还引入 <code>ml-dsa</code> 等后量子签名类型。</p>\n<p><strong>派生密钥与收敛加密解决两个特定难题。</strong> <code>derived=true</code> 时 Transit 用 HKDF 从主密钥 + 调用方提供的 <code>context</code> 派生子密钥，同样的 <code>context</code> 总得到同样的密钥，适合&quot;每租户一把逻辑密钥&quot;但不建实体 key 的场景。<code>convergent_encryption</code> 让相同明文产生相同密文，代价是泄露等值关系，只用于需要按密文做等值查询的列，绝不可用于 PII。</p>\n<p><strong>合规视角。</strong> PCI DSS v4.0.1 中大量&quot;future-dated&quot;要求已于 2025 年 3 月 31 日成为强制项，密钥管理（要求 3.6/3.7）对强度、留存周期与访问控制有更细规定；GDPR 第 32 条把&quot;加密&quot;列为适当的技术措施；中国 PIPL 第 38 条对个人信息出境要求安全评估或认证。对跨境电商而言，密钥托管位置本身就是合规变量：面向中国用户的 PII 若用境外 KMS 托管 KEK，可能触及数据出境评估；常见做法是按区域用各自云的 KMS 做主密钥，再用 Transit 做字段级加密，让&quot;密钥驻留地&quot;与&quot;数据驻留地&quot;一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三层密钥链</strong>：unseal key（或云 KMS 主密钥）→ root key → keyring/barrier key；任何一层泄露都等于失守。</li>\n<li><strong>Barrier 用 AES-256-GCM，path 作 AAD、密文头部带 4 字节 term</strong>：位置绑定防篡改与自描述版本是两大设计要点。</li>\n<li><strong><code>rotate</code> 换 barrier key、<code>rekey</code> 换 root key</strong>，两者都不重写业务数据——分层密钥带来 O(1) 轮换，这是&quot;90 天轮换&quot;能落地的原因。</li>\n<li><strong>Seal Wrap 是 FIPS 场景的双层保护</strong>；2026 年 9 月后 FIPS 140-2 证书已进历史列表，新部署应直接锚定 FIPS 140-3。</li>\n<li><strong>Transit 是加密即服务</strong>：密文 <code>vault:v&lt;N&gt;:...</code> 自描述，用 <code>rewrap</code> 而非&quot;解密再加密&quot;滚动版本，用 datakey 做信封加密规避性能瓶颈。</li>\n<li><strong>合规与密钥驻留地绑定</strong>：PCI DSS v4.0.1 与 GDPR/PIPL 共同决定 KEK 该托管在哪、能否跨境。轮换与区域托管策略是本章与《<a href=\"../rotation-kms-ha-ops/\">轮换、KMS 集成与高可用运维</a>》的衔接点；存储侧物理模型见同章《<a href=\"storage-backend-physical-model\">存储后端抽象与物理存储模型</a>》。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Barrier 加密、根密钥层级与 Transit 加密即服务","id":"barrier-加密-根密钥层级与-transit-加密即服务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"根密钥层级：从 unseal key 到 barrier key","id":"根密钥层级-从-unseal-key-到-barrier-key"},{"level":2,"text":"Barrier 加密的实现细节","id":"barrier-加密的实现细节"},{"level":2,"text":"轮换：rotate 与 rekey 的分工","id":"轮换-rotate-与-rekey-的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"Transit 加密即服务","id":"transit-加密即服务"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存储后端抽象与物理存储模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/vault-storage-barrier/storage-backend-physical-model"},"next":{"title":"密封解封、自动解封与灾难恢复实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/vault-storage-barrier/seal-unseal-auto-unseal-recovery"}}